	second factor they are $\Id \ot M_a$. In both cases the effects are positive
	and sum to the identity of the bipartite space, so the comparisons of
	Lemma~\ref{lem:pasting}, whose two sides are placed families, are comparisons
	of measurements and the consistency calculus applies to them.
\end{definition}

